line	
line	<col=000080>Reach the <col=800000>Death Plateau</col>. (<col=800000>Games necklace</col> or <col=800000>minigame teleport</col> to <col=800000>Burthorpe</col>). There will be <col=800000>thrower troll</col>s on the way there and on the plateau itself; protect from ranged.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Go to the Troll Stronghold, head south then downstairs into the kitchen (fairycode AJR and enter from the back through the secret door where you freed the prisoners, or utilise a slayer ring and enter the mountain through the secret entrance, or Trollheim teleport and go west).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm, east of Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach the Death Plateau. (Games necklace or minigame teleport to Burthorpe). There will be thrower trolls on the way there and on the plateau itself; protect from ranged.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use a bucket on the <col=800000>cooking pot</col> in the middle of the plateau with 1 free inventory space to get the <col=800000>goutweedy lump</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Go to the Troll Stronghold, head south then downstairs into the kitchen (fairycode AJR and enter from the back through the secret door where you freed the prisoners, or utilise a slayer ring and enter the mountain through the secret entrance, or Trollheim teleport and go west).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm, east of Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach the Death Plateau. (Games necklace or minigame teleport to Burthorpe). There will be thrower trolls on the way there and on the plateau itself; protect from ranged.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a bucket on the cooking pot in the middle of the plateau with 1 free inventory space to get the goutweedy lump.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go back to the <col=800000>Troll Stronghold</col> and talk to My Arm.</col>
