line	<str>After he brings you to a new area, talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>After reading the book he gave you, talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use three buckets of Ugthanki dung and seven buckets of supercompost on the soil patch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Barnaby.</str>
line	
line	<str>Meet up with My Arm at Tai Bwo Wannai, east of the general store. Talk to him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Murcaily near the hardwood grove. Make sure you have at least 1 free inventory space.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene speak to My Arm, you will take the boat back to Ardougne where you can access the bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare yourself for a level 75 fight and a level 172 fight.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the roof of the Troll Stronghold by using ladder in the west room on the upper level where the Troll Generals are.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give My Arm the tools he needs for farming in this order:</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Defeat the two monsters.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to My Arm.</col>
step	22	-	Quick guide step 22
line	<str>Go to the Troll Stronghold, head south then downstairs into the kitchen (fairycode AJR and enter from the back through the secret door where you freed the prisoners, or utilise a slayer ring and enter the mountain through the secret entrance, or Trollheim teleport and go west).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm, east of Burntmeat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach the Death Plateau. (Games necklace or minigame teleport to Burthorpe). There will be thrower trolls on the way there and on the plateau itself; protect from ranged.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a bucket on the cooking pot in the middle of the plateau with 1 free inventory space to get the goutweedy lump.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Troll Stronghold and talk to My Arm.</str>
